      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could be guarded with CONFIG_I2C, to potentially save code size if a board enabled SPI and disabled I2C.  But this is probably a very unlikely combination, so I\u0027m good without a guard.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 171,
