      "writtenOn": "2020-04-29T17:45:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I add the CONFIG_BMI_I2C and CONFIG_BMI_SPI macro to guard the code. CONFIG_BMI_I2C will be defined if the board is using I2C port on BMI, and so will CONFIG_BMI_SPI.\nGwendal, I am not sure if I should eliminate SLAVE_IS_SPI. Will there be some cases that the BMI use both I2C and SPI?",
